    "narrative": "Ghost Ride the WHIP enters today\u2019s slate with **James Wood** serving as our clear focal point. With a stellar score of 76.28, **James Wood** draws a favorable matchup against Giolito (xERA 5.37). Batting out of the leadoff spot and benefiting from neutral platoon splits, he possesses the highest ceiling of any hitter on the active roster. We are also bullish on **Josh Naylor** (65.16) and **Austin Riley** (64.99); **Josh Naylor** capitalizes on strong order positioning and a favorable interaction with Gallen, while **Austin Riley** benefits significantly from a soft matchup against Paddack, whose high xERA (4.53) provides the necessary runway for **Austin Riley** to anchor the heart of our lineup. \n\nEfficiency remains tight at the margins, particularly regarding our pursuit of SB. **Corbin Carroll** (62.47) is a mandatory start despite facing Kirby (3.46), as the combination of his elite speed against a slower delivery and his #2 lineup placement offsets the tough SP skill. Conversely, **Jose Caballero** (59.06) remains in the lineup primarily for his legs, though we are monitoring the risk posed by the elite catching battery he faces today. Our most difficult bench decision involved **Vinnie Pasquantino** (43.95). While **Vinnie Pasquantino** remains a key depth piece, the severe L/L platoon disadvantage against Gore pushed his efficiency below the threshold occupied by our infield starters like **Tyler Soderstrom** and **Brice Turang**. \n\nRisks today center on the uncertainty of the daily lineups for **Gabriel Moreno**, **Corbin Carroll**, and **Jose Caballero**, where our projections rely on assumed batting positions. We are also keeping a close eye on the performance of **Travis Bazzana**; while his leadoff status provides a nice +10% bump to his score, the L/L disadvantage against Samaniego makes him a player to watch closely as the game progresses. With **Mickey Moniak** sidelined on the IL, the onus is on **Zach McKinstry** to provide efficient utility production, though his lower score of 47.33 indicates we are strictly playing the percentages regarding his platoon edge.",
